# STAR AV ASSIST — server-side AI key. NEVER prefix with VITE_ (that would
# expose it to the browser). This file is a template — copy it to `.env`.

GEMINI_API_KEY=
# optional — defaults to gemini-3.6-flash
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.6-flash

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LOCAL DEV (npm run dev): put GEMINI_API_KEY in `staravs/.env`. The Vite
# middleware reads it server-side.
#
# HOSTINGER (production): the key must live on the SERVER, not in the uploaded
# build. Best option, in order of preference:
#   1) hPanel → Advanced → set an environment variable GEMINI_API_KEY, OR
#   2) create a file named `.env` ONE LEVEL ABOVE public_html (not web-
#      accessible) containing:  GEMINI_API_KEY=your_key_here
#      (api/chat.php looks there automatically), OR
#   3) a `.env` inside public_html (already blocked from web access by .htaccess).
# Never commit `.env` and never put the key in the dist/ upload except via
# option 2/3 above as a server-only file.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
